# Screens module
error-ui-backend-unknown = ordin received an update from a source it doesn't know and ignored it.
error-ui-block-kind-unknown = Part of this page can't be shown in this version of ordin. Update ordin to see it.
error-ui-catalogue-reload-failed = ordin couldn't load the new language wording, so it is still using the previous text.
error-ui-chart-render-failed = This chart couldn't be drawn. Try again.
error-ui-command-timeout = That took too long and got no answer. Try again.
error-ui-event-kind-unknown = ordin received something from a newer version that this one can't show, so it was skipped.
error-ui-event-version = ordin received an update from a different version and ignored it. Update ordin.
error-ui-ipc-failed = The window couldn't reach the rest of ordin. Close ordin and open it again.
error-ui-knowledge-address-not-https = That address must start with https://. Check it and try again.
error-ui-link-refused = ordin didn't open that link because it isn't a valid Slack link.
error-ui-message-missing = Some wording isn't available in your language, so the English wording is shown.
error-ui-storage-unavailable = ordin couldn't save your window preferences, so they may reset next time.
